---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Top Picks | CCG Eleventy Prototype
description: Browse Cheeky Commodore Gamer favourites preserved from the existing Top Picks collection.
permalink: /games/collections/top-picks/index.html
---
<section class="hero hero--compact">
  <p class="eyebrow">COLLECTION PROTOTYPE</p>
  <h1>{{ collectionArchive.topPicks.name }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ collectionArchive.topPicks.description }}</p>
</section>

<section class="archive-browser" aria-labelledby="top-picks-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="top-picks-heading">Games in this collection</h2>
    <p>{{ collectionArchive.topPicks.games | length }} entries preserved from the existing collection fallback markup.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="game-grid">
    {% for game in collectionArchive.topPicks.games %}
      {% include "components/game-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
